            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.24.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 24:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ku yaaherize kubara abantu, omutima gwe gwamushinja; yaagira MUKAMA ati: Ncumwire munonga ahabw'ekyo eki nkozire. Kwonka mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, ai MUKAMA, iha aha mwiru waawe okutahikiirira; ahakuba ndengyesereize, naakora eky'obufa-mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.13.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 13:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi ku yaimukire omu kasheeshe, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaizira nabi Gaadi, omuhanuuzi wa Daudi, nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gyenda ogire Daudi oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba, naagira ati: Naakuha ebintu bishatu, oiheho kimwe, mbe nikyo naakukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Gaadi yaija ahari Daudi, yaakimugambira; yaamugira ati: Ahari ebi bishatu ihaho kimwe, ensi yaawe okuteerwa enjara emyaka mushanju; nari okuguma noohunga abazigu baawe bakubingire okumara ameezi ashatu; nari ensi yaawe okujuumikirwa orufu okumara ebiro bishatu. Mbwenu teekateeka, ongambire eki ndaagarukyemu Ontumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.119.156"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 119:156",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi yaagira Gaadi ati: Naashobererwa kimwe; ka tugwe omu mikono ya MUKAMA, ahakuba embabazi ze ni nyingi; ndekye kugwa omu mikono y'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
