              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaajuumikiza Israeli orufu, okwiha omuri ako kasheeshe okuhitsya aha bunaku obutairweho; haafa abantu obukumi mushanju, okuruga Daani okuhika Beeri-sheba. ",
