            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.12.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 12:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka maraika ku yaabangiire Yerusaalemu omukono kugicwekyereza, MUKAMA yaayegarukamu ahabw'ako kabi, yaagira maraika owaabaire naacwekyereza abantu ati: Ekyo nikimara. Banguura omukono. Obwo maraika wa MUKAMA akaba ari haihi n'embuga ya Arauna Omuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ku yaareebire maraika owaabaire naita abantu, yaagira MUKAMA ati: Reeba, niinye ncumwire, nkashiisha mononga; mbwenu entaama ezi zo zikozire ki? Ninkweshengyereza, omukono gwawe gube niinye gwarwanisa n'enju ya tata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eryo izooba Gaadi yaija ahari Daudi, yaamugira ati: Inamuka, oyombekyere MUKAMA eitambiro aha mbuga ya Arauna Omuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Daudi yainamuka, ahabw'ekigambo kya Gaadi eki MUKAMA amuragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe n'abagaragwa be nibaija ah'ari; yaashohora, yainama omu maisho g'omugabe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.48"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 16:48",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Arauna yaabuuza ati: N'enki ekyareeta mukama wangye omugabe aha mwiru we? Daudi yaamugarukamu ati: Naareetwa okugura embuga yaawe, kwombekyera MUKAMA eitambiro, ngu orufu rurugye omu bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arauna yaagira Daudi ati: Mukama wangye omugabe atware eki arikwenda kyona, akihongye; reeba ente ez'ekitambo ky'okwotsya nzizi, n'ebihuuzo n'emigamba y'ente mubiihemu enku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.33.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 33:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebyo byona, Nyakusinga, nyowe Arauna naabiha omugabe. Yaagaruka yaagira omugabe ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akwikirize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka omugabe yaagira Arauna ati: Ngaaha; buzimazima niinyija kubigura naiwe, nkuhe obuguzi bwabyo. Tindikwija kuhongyera MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye ebitambo by'okwotsya, ebi ntaheereire byangye. Atyo Daudi yaagura egyo mbuga n'ezo nte shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.21.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 21:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Daudi yaayombekyerayo MUKAMA eitambiro, yaatamba ebitambo by'okwotsya n'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. Atyo MUKAMA yaahurira ebi yaayeshengyereziibwe ahabw'ensi; orufu rwaruga omuri Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
